## 2. Membership number logic (and the year segment)

Derived, not persisted — `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java` (lines 159-162):
```java
@Transient
public String getMembershipNumber() {
    return this.customerCode + "-M" + String.format("%02d", this.registrationDate.getYear() % 100);
}
```
The "year segment" = `-M` + last two digits (`year % 100`, zero-padded) of `registrationDate.getYear()`. Example `LON-SMI-0007-M26`. Note: it calls `registrationDate.getYear()` with no null guard, so it depends on the date default in `BuildOwner` having run.

`customerCode` prefix is built in `BuildOwner.nextCustomerCode(...)` as `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>` where `NNNN` = (owners already in that city, case-insensitive) + 1:
```java
String city3 = city.substring(0, Math.min(3, city.length())).toUpperCase();
